harges apply</strong>.</p><p>Delivery concerns must be reported <strong>within 15 days of receipt</strong>.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>6. RETURNS & EXCHANGES</strong></p><p>Returns are accepted strictly in accordance with our <strong>Return Policy</strong>.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>7. COPYRIGHT & WEBSITE CONTENT</strong></p><p>This website, including its design, text, graphics, product images, and content, is the <strong>exclusive intellectual property of Imperial Mastercrafts</strong> and is protected under applicable copyright laws.</p><ul><li><strong>Copying, reproducing, altering, or imitating any part of the website is strictly prohibited.</strong></li><li>This includes content displayed on our social media platforms (Instagram, Facebook, Pinterest, YouTube, Twitter, etc.).</li><li>Any unauthorized reproduction, plagiarism, or misuse <strong>may result in legal action</strong> under laws governed by the <strong>Supreme Court of India</strong>.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>8. TRADEMARKS</strong></p><p>All trademarks, logos, brand names, and product names displayed on this website are the <strong>property of Imperial Mastercrafts</strong>.</p><p>You may not use any mark without <strong>prior written consent</strong>.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>9. THIRD-PARTY LINKS</strong></p><p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites.<br/>These are provided for convenience only — <strong>we do not control or endorse these websites</strong> and are not responsible for any content or consequences arising from their use.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>10. PROHIBITED USER CONDUCT</strong></p><p>You agree <strong>NOT</strong> to upload, share, transmit, or publish any content that:</p><ul><li>Belongs to another person without authorization</li><li>Is defamatory, obscene, pornographic, harmful, hateful, abusive, or unlawful</li><li>Encourages harm to minors</li><li>Infringes any copyright, trademark, or proprietary rights</li><li>Violates any Indian law</li><li>Contains malware, viruses, or disruptive code</li><li>Impersonates another individual</li><li>Threatens national security, sovereignty, or public order</li><li>Disrupts or overloads the website infrastructure</li></ul><p>Any violation may lead to <strong>account suspension, legal liability, and/or reporting to authorities.</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>11. CREDIT / DEBIT CARD & PAYMENT INFORMATION</strong></p><p>You confirm that the payment information you provide is <strong>accurate and lawfully owned by you</strong>.</p><p>We <strong>do not store card details</strong> and do not share such data except where required:</p><ul><li>For verification</li><li>For fraud prevention</li><li>Under court or legal authority directives</li></ul><p>We are <strong>not responsible</strong> for credit card fraud. The responsibility to prove unauthorized usage lies with the user.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>12. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</strong></p><p>Imperial Mastercrafts is not liable for:</p><ul><li>Delivery delays or courier issues beyond our control</li><li>Unauthorized access to customer data</li><li>Any loss arising from fraudulent card activity</li><li>Service interruptions, data errors, or website downtime</li></ul><p>All products and website services are provided <strong>“as is”</strong>.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>13. INDEMNIFICATION</strong></p><p>You agree to indemnify and hold Imperial Mastercrafts harmless from any claims arising out of:</p><ul><li>Your misuse of the website</li><li>Your breach of these terms</li><li>Your violation of laws or third-party rights</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong>14. GOVERNING LAW</strong></p><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of <strong>India</strong>, and all disputes are subject exclusively to the jurisdiction of <strong>courts in Delhi</strong>.</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>15. CONTACT INFORMATION</strong></p><p>For queries, please contact:<br/><strong>Email:</strong> info@imperialknots.com<br/><br/></p>"
